  "slug": "banquet-order-request-form",
  "title": "Banquet Order Request Form",
  "subtitle": "Ask banquets and culinary to price and confirm a function before a banquet event order is written, and record what each department can actually deliver.",
  "description": "An original internal request that starts a banquet function. Sales states the function profile, room and service expectations, and menu direction; banquets, culinary, and audio-visual record what they can deliver and at what cost. It captures routing, department feasibility responses, the pricing decision, unresolved requirements, and the handoff into a banquet event order.",
  "use_case": "Use when a seller needs banquets and culinary to confirm feasibility and cost for a function before committing it to a client. The request closes when every department has responded, the pricing decision is recorded, and either a banquet event order number is assigned or the request is withdrawn.",
  "risk_tier": "A",
