          "key": "request_boundary",
          "type": "notice",
          "label": "Scope of this request",
          "guidance": "This request records feasibility and indicative pricing between departments. It is not a client quote, a confirmed menu, a capacity determination, or an allergen assurance. Nothing here may be presented to the client until it appears on an approved banquet event order, and capacity, egress, licensing, and allergen questions stay with the responsible manager."
        }
